# Phase 9 baseline manifest
# Deterministic file list (LC_ALL=C path-sorted) with SHA-256 hashes over the committed Git blob content (not the
# Windows checkout bytes), covering the complete Phase 9 implementation baseline set: the evidence engine (anticheat-evidence:
# EvidenceEvent, EvidenceLedger, EvidenceSnapshot, EvidenceVocabulary, EvidenceBounds, ValidationRecord), its core composition
# (EvidenceRunner, ValidationEvidenceMapper, EvidenceStatus, EvidenceEngineStatus, PacketEngine, the /papea2ac evidence command) and
# the forward corrections P9-F1..P9-F5 in anticheat-physics / -simulation / -player / -core (sprint-modifier classes, BlockDisputeLedger,
# start-pose sneak scaling and the crouching rest anchor, the client-loaded tick rule, the PUSHER entity class and bundle mapping),
# the diagnostic ForensicCapture; tests, benchmarks, Gradle task changes, the Phase 9 report, the human approval record, and the
# artifacts under docs/phase9-artifacts/ (regenerated reference data, fixtures, corpora results, JMH, memory, verification, the
# forensic captures and the force-added qualification logs). The production code is exactly the code of the live-qualified plugin
# jar 297134a6425c03959ad3342e67b1179dda52e0b5ed4262308e89001e240a99da (byte-identical --rerun-tasks rebuild).
# This manifest file itself is not listed.
